"A battle for air superiority fought between two large airbases, using high-end assets. Rank 3 aircraft available at start."
"A combined-arms battle on the eastern half of the map, limited to smaller aircraft. Each side has one main airbase and one forward airbase, with naval assets watching the flanks."
"A duel between two light carriers; the Cursor-class LFD of BDF and the Devotion-class Escort Carrier of PALA. Both carriers start with their full respective air wings and do not get resupplies."
"A fast-paced PvP scenario where BDF must defend their supercarrier fleet in the newly introduced FS-41 Eclipse and PALA must destroy the fleet with advanced supersonic bombers escorted by multirole fighters.\n\nBBDF's objective is to protect the CSG and destroy a heavily fortified PALA airbase in the occupied Feldspar International Airport.\n\nPALA's objective is to destroy the BDF carrier strike group."
